    "html": "\r\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\r\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\r\n    <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\r\n    <span class=\"chip\">Interview Hub</span>\r\n    <span class=\"chip\">Coding round</span>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <h1>Common coding-round mistakes</h1>\r\n  <p class=\"lead\">Eight mistakes that sink candidates who could solve the problem: jumping to code, loops without a clear invariant, integer overflow, mutating the input, recursion that is too deep, wrong complexity claims, poor names and silence. Each comes with the symptom, the fix and a worked example, plus three small templates that avoid four of them by construction.</p>\r\n  <p class=\"small prereq\"><b>Before this page:</b> <a href=\"{{BASE}}coding/coding-complexity\">Complexity</a> and <a href=\"{{BASE}}coding/coding-testing-your-code\">Testing your code</a>. <b>Also:</b> <a href=\"{{BASE}}coding/coding-company-patterns\">Company coding patterns</a>.</p>\r\n",
